From 9929aa14765b785388f7da8d7a61c6df70a3a0b9 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: hiper25 <whydonit@gmail.com>
Date: Wed, 21 Oct 2026 01:06:33 +0800
Subject: [PATCH] arm64: dts: amlogic: Correct the HK1 RBOX X4 667 MHz OPP

Both the shipped DT and the live Android DT encode 667000000 Hz at
799000 uV. The previous decimal decode incorrectly declared 666 MHz.
Correct the node, rate and consumer comment without changing voltage,
clock rounding tolerance or CPU/DSU sequencing.

Series validation: production Image/modules/DTB build and full DT schema.
Physical DVFS acceptance is unchanged; deployment keeps CPUFreq disabled.

Change-Id: Ief0af96185791d588af7f9888d845ca47fc5fbc7
---
 arch/arm64/boot/dts/amlogic/meson-sc2-hk1-rbox-x4.dts | 4 ++--
 drivers/cpufreq/sc2-cpufreq.c                         | 2 +-
 2 files changed, 3 insertions(+), 3 deletions(-)

diff --git a/arch/arm64/boot/dts/amlogic/meson-sc2-hk1-rbox-x4.dts b/arch/arm64/boot/dts/amlogic/meson-sc2-hk1-rbox-x4.dts
index 63c87760582d0bf5ce5479165f45f4bf767026bc..fa08def55fcabd27e45dc5fe5fad9fb5e4227841 100644
--- a/arch/arm64/boot/dts/amlogic/meson-sc2-hk1-rbox-x4.dts
+++ b/arch/arm64/boot/dts/amlogic/meson-sc2-hk1-rbox-x4.dts
@@ -213,8 +213,8 @@ opp-500000000 {
 			opp-hz = /bits/ 64 <500000000>;
 			opp-microvolt = <779000>;
 		};
-		opp-666000000 {
-			opp-hz = /bits/ 64 <666000000>;
+		opp-667000000 {
+			opp-hz = /bits/ 64 <667000000>;
 			opp-microvolt = <799000>;
 		};
 		opp-1000000000 {
diff --git a/drivers/cpufreq/sc2-cpufreq.c b/drivers/cpufreq/sc2-cpufreq.c
index 796b37dc4916a8583e4aa01e030ab75855181fe9..498331418977495791a4cc7147b36f58f6dd02a5 100644
--- a/drivers/cpufreq/sc2-cpufreq.c
+++ b/drivers/cpufreq/sc2-cpufreq.c
@@ -107,7 +107,7 @@ static int sc2_cpufreq_config_clks(struct device *dev, struct opp_table *table,
 	if (ret)
 		goto failed;
 
-	/* The fixed 2 GHz / 3 path rounds the stock 666 MHz OPP. */
+	/* The fixed 2 GHz / 3 path rounds the stock 667 MHz OPP. */
 	if (abs((long)clk_get_rate(core) - (long)rate) > 10000000) {
 		ret = -EIO;
 		goto failed;
